        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Rush Highway</strong> takes the classic overtaking mechanics and transforms them into something entirely new. Forget ordinary highways — here you’ll encounter giant chickens, zebras, ancient pyramids, glowing skulls, and surreal retro cityscapes. It’s not just a reflex challenge; it’s a visual and artistic journey.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-speed endless overtaking gameplay<br></li><li>Retro neon environments inspired by the 80s and 90s<br></li><li>Surreal surprises: giant animals, glowing artifacts, strange parallel worlds<br></li><li>Multiple vehicle choices to master<br></li><li>Addictive, replayable arcade experience</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Rush Highway appeals both to fans of classic arcade racers and to players who want to explore unusual, dreamlike atmospheres. Every run is a new scene, a new surprise, a new adventure.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Rush Highway</strong> takes the classic overtaking mechanics and transforms them into something entirely new. Forget ordinary highways — here you’ll encounter giant chickens, zebras, ancient pyramids, glowing skulls, and surreal retro cityscapes. It’s not just a reflex challenge; it’s a visual and artistic journey.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-speed endless overtaking gameplay<br></li><li>Retro neon environments inspired by the 80s and 90s<br></li><li>Surreal surprises: giant animals, glowing artifacts, strange parallel worlds<br></li><li>Multiple vehicle choices to master<br></li><li>Addictive, replayable arcade experience</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Rush Highway appeals both to fans of classic arcade racers and to players who want to explore unusual, dreamlike atmospheres. Every run is a new scene, a new surprise, a new adventure.</p>",
        "short_description": "Neon Rush Highway isn’t just a racing game; it’s a surreal speed experience. Drive through endless roads filled with retro neon landscapes, giant animals, and unexpected hallucination-like surprises.",
